<view class="container b2-page b2-d04 af2-page lv2-page lv2-role">
  <view class="header">
    <text class="title">选择员工身份</text>
    <text class="subtitle">按本次工作职责继续</text>
  </view>

  <view class="role-list">
    <view class="role-card af-entry af-entry--feature station-manager {{selecting ? 'busy' : ''}}" bindtap="onSelectStationManager">
      <view class="lv2-role-icon"><icon name="building" size="32px" color="#244F82" variant="duotone" fill-color="#DCEAFF" /></view>
      <view class="role-info">
        <text class="role-name">我是站长</text>
        <text class="role-desc">创建水站 · 管理订单与员工</text>
      </view>
      <text class="role-arrow">›</text>
    </view>

    <view class="role-card af-entry af-entry--feature delivery {{selecting ? 'busy' : ''}}" bindtap="onSelectDelivery">
      <view class="lv2-role-icon"><icon name="user" size="32px" color="#244F82" variant="duotone" fill-color="#DCEAFF" /></view>
      <view class="role-info">
        <text class="role-name">我是配送员</text>
        <text class="role-desc">加入水站 · 审批后接单配送</text>
      </view>
      <text class="role-arrow">›</text>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="footer-tip">
    <text>选择身份只是登记意向，建站或绑定获批后才生效。</text>
    <help-tip title="更换身份" text="生效前可返回重选；生效后请联系管理员。" />
  </view>
</view>
<business-dialog id="business-dialog" />
